{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:08 2026-09-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:08 2026-09-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:08 2026-09-17 HKT</p><p>啟德今日（9月17日）晚上8時許數人報案，表示沐禮街一公屋地盤低層位置起火。網上片段所見現場火光熊熊，冒出黑煙，大批街坊隔著鐵欄圍觀。消防接報後趕至拖喉撲救，起火原因仍在調查。</p><img alt=\"大批街坊圍觀。Threads：brownbeech\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/233e299af011a90e555791fee6204423/2026-09/vlcsnap-2026-09-17-21h05m45s345.png\"/><img alt=\"起火位置位於地盤低層。Threads：brownbeech\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eeb8b52fc80862f8006dfcbd45470054/2026-09/vlcsnap-2026-09-17-21h05m56s322.png\"/><img alt=\"現場為一公屋地盤。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6472d45dad56b0031991cf386c29f761/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_21_22_09.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防拖喉灌救。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/870182b5fcead252919496107d6065f8/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_21_22_10.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防拖喉灌救。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e2dc49e7881619ff13fc155700617b61/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_21_22_11_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"起火原因仍在調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9947db1bf99d7ebbe8688b80ad08abc7/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_21_22_11.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"起火原因仍在調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/027d3e16e3d4df88a164544ce5e01e5f/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_21_22_11_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T13:59:42.002878+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}